    "english": {
      "headingRaw": "Seven-character-regular-verseDuFuNIGHTINTHEWATCH-TOWER",
      "translationRaw": "WhilewinterdaylightshortensintheelementalscaleAndsnowandfrostwhitenthecold-circlingnight，Starksoundsthefifth-watchwithachallengeofdrumandbugle。。。。ThestarsandtheRiverofHeavenpulseoverthethreemountains；Ihearwomeninthedistance，wailingafterthebattle；Iseebarbarianfishermenandwoodcuttersinthedawn。。。。Sleeping-Dragon，Plunging-Horse，arenogeneralsnow，theyaredust--Hushforamoment，Otumultoftheworld。",
